WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.088 --> 00:00:02.568
-We're hanging out
with Allison Janney!

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:04.971
Wow!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.273
Allison, your show "Mom"

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.075
is about a mother-daughter
relationship.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.544
So in honor of that, we thought
we'd try something fun.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.279
We asked people online
to help us out

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.815
by sending in
some real text exchanges

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.850
that they've had with their mom.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:20.687
And I thought that we could read
some of our favorites together.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:24.224
It is time for
"Dramatic Mom Texts."

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.093
-♪ "Dramatic Mom Texts" ♪

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.094
♪ "Dramatic Mom Texts" ♪

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:32.198
-Alright, you should know
that all these texts are real.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.634
For the texts,
you'll be playing the mom,

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.335
and I will be playing
the son or daughter.

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:37.636
Does that sound good?

00:00:37.636 --> 00:00:38.738
-Copy that.
-Perfect.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.406
Alright, great.
Here we go.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:42.208
We'll begin
whenever you're ready.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.911
-Okay.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:48.481
"Sweetheart, don't forget
to unload the dishwasher.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.185
Did you finish your homework?

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:55.421
We have to go to
your grandmother's house

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:58.391
for Thanksgiving.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.659
Dad and I talked.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:02.661
We are going to buy you a car
next month."

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:05.565
-"U are???
Omg thank u."

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.066
-Yeah.
"No. We're not.

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.936
I just wanted to make sure
you were getting my texts."

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.237
-"That was cruel."

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:13.973
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.242
[ Laughs ]

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.244
Okay.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.647
Let's do another.
I'll start.

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.981
-Okay.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:27.286
-"Hi, Mom."

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.389
-"Waving hand emoji."

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:32.291
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:34.293
-"How are you?"

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.229
-"Thumbs up emoji."

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.363
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:40.766
-"What's for dinner?"

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:43.702
-"Pizza emoji."

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:47.307
-"Why don't you just use
the actual emojis?"

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:50.743
-"Don't know how!
Sad emoji."

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.879
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.951
That is fun.

00:01:58.951 --> 00:02:02.188
For this next one,
Allison, you'll start.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:04.491
-Okay. Okay.
[ Clears throat ]

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:06.492
-Yep.

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:10.262
-"What's the song
like doodads bop

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:14.833
maybe by the Jonas Brothers
or some boy band?"

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:18.104
-"Hmm. I'm not sure."

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:23.676
-"Doodads Bop.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:27.847
Bop Doodads Doodad Bop.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:32.585
Doodad Bop Doodad
Bop Bop Doodads."

00:02:35.821 --> 00:02:37.957
-"'MMMBop' by Hanson?"

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.358
-"Yes!

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:41.094
I'm making a playlist for you."

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:42.795
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:47.766
Doodads bop.

00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:49.068
[ Laughs ]

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.270
Alright.
Let's do another one here.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.138
You will start.

00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:55.141
-I will start.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:59.545
-"Andyidontknowwhere
thespacebaris."

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:01.681
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:06.518
-"It's in the middle
at the bottom.

00:03:06.518 --> 00:03:08.454
It's labeled 'SPACE.'"

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.957
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:13.760
-"Idontseeitandy
couldyoubemorespecific?"

00:03:15.594 --> 00:03:19.732
-"I don't know how much clearer
I could be."

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:22.468
-"I found it!"

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.504
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:29.241 --> 00:03:30.810
Alright.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.345
Let's do another.
This time I'll start.

00:03:33.345 --> 00:03:35.381
Here we go.
-Okay. Wait. Okay. Alright.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.283
-Ready?
-Okay. Yeah.

00:03:39.651 --> 00:03:42.355
-"Mom, where are you?"

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:44.390
-"Leaving Walmart.
Halfway home.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.026
Why, sweetie?"

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.262
-"You brought me
to Walmart with you."

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:51.497
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:53.032
-"Oh, darn!

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:54.467
Be there in a bit."

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:56.002
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:56.002 --> 00:03:59.172
-My thanks to Allison Janney!

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:02.074
You can see the final season
of "Mom"

00:04:02.074 --> 00:04:05.177
Thursdays at 9:00 p.m. on CBS.

00:04:05.177 --> 00:04:06.546
I'll never forget this.

